Package: twelvedataR
Title: Access Twelve Data Financial Market Data from R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Viet Tien", "Trinh", , "vietr933@student.liu.se", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Zhengyu", "Wang", , "zhewa470@student.liu.se", role = "aut"))
Description: Provides a small client for the Twelve Data REST API. Retrieve
    historical OHLCV price series and the latest quote as base R data frames,
    with input validation and clear API error messages.
